// Title: Triple Cross eBPF Rootkit Install Commands
// ID: 22236d75-d5a0-4287-bf06-c93b1770860f
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-07-05
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1014
// Description: Detects default install commands of the Triple Cross eBPF rootkit based on the "deployer.sh" script
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (process.executable endswith "/sudo" and (process.command_line like "*_ tc *" and process.command_line like "*_ enp0s3 *") and (process.command_line like "*_ qdisc *" or process.command_line like "*_ filter *"))
